<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to late last week, slaughter steers and heifers sold fully steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1050-1250 lbs 61.00-63.25.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1200 lbs 59.00-60.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Few Choice 2-4 1000-1150 lbs 60.70-62.00.</p>
<p>Few sales Select and Choice 2-3 1075-1125 lbs 60.00.</p>
</text>
